says the mazda 3 is serious competition  for the volkswagen golf and unlike it  the mazda also comes in sedan and  fastback  versions hatchback or fastback that is  the question  since the mazda3 was introduced in 2003  it has been praised for its excellent  driving dynamics  now in its third generation it not only  handles well but is also very  comfortable  mazda calls its design philosophy kodo  soul emotion  it's about muscular vigor  dynamic poise plus elegant detail  its distinctive front body lines and  powerful stance embody this philosophy  the model we are testing is the 2.2  liter diesel producing 110 kilowatts of  power with sports nav trim  it accelerates from zero to 100  kilometers an hour in 8.1 seconds the  price in germany is just over 25 and a  half thousand euros  the signature mazda face featuring the  winged grille flows seamlessly around  the sleek by xenon headlights enhancing  the car's sporty dynamic presence the  sculpted forms create an impression of  powerful forward movement the stance is  strong and wide character lines flow  along the body inspired the company says  by the powerful smooth movement of  nature  the problem with sedans in general is  the limited height of the trunk but here  in the mazda 3 the opening is nice and  wide and she prefers the look of a sedan  so they felt mirror  the interior is clean and uncluttered  all the instruments are in easy reach  there is a pleasing counterpoint between  the cockpit's chrome detailing and its  dark tones  the mazda 3's interior resembles that of  mazda's other models it's neat serious  and spacious without being cavernous  michelle doesn't feel squeezed in behind  the wheel or lost in space  the mazda 3 hugs the road the handling  is impeccable mazda's sky active  technology focused on lowering weight to  enhance performance and efficiency gets  the best out of the engines increasing  torque while lowering co2 emissions and  fuel consumption  michelle says the 110 kilowatt diesel  engine makes this a fun car to drive  it's responsive and the ride is nice and  sporty  the sky active body is both lightweight  and ultra strong and the sky active  chassis provides an ideal blend of  precise handling and ride comfort  the result is a dynamic nimble drive it  is really fun even on a routine run to  work or to the supermarket
 

